00:26:50.019 --> 00:26:51.810
So really we're going
to talk about the two

00:26:51.810 --> 00:26:54.570
components of Cloud ML
Engine, the training

00:26:54.570 --> 00:26:57.550
and serving piece and dive
a little bit into the code.

00:26:57.550 --> 00:26:59.160
So first of all,
Cloud ML Engine again

00:26:59.160 --> 00:27:02.040
is a managed machine
learning service.

00:27:02.040 --> 00:27:05.160
We are-- we're essentially also
giving you on-demand access

00:27:05.160 --> 00:27:05.769
to GPUs.

00:27:05.769 --> 00:27:07.560
Andrie mentioned me
and him worked together

00:27:07.560 --> 00:27:12.780
